      "role": "user",
      "content": "so it's like a tiny ecosystem. i guess it's just hard to wrap my head around how all these things just happen \"in the dark\" inside the dough. does it ever feel like there's something more goings on than just chemistry when you're watching the starter bubble up or change? like, how do you tell if the balance is actually being maintained just by looking at it?",
